Create a heartbeat controller to handle the /heartbeat POST endpoint.
Implement logic to register heartbeats and save to the database.
Create a services overview controller for the /services POST endpoint.
Implement logic to retrieve and return registered services based on token.
Set up the main application module to import controllers and database providers.
Create the main entry point in main.ts to bootstrap the Nest application.
Write unit tests for the controllers to ensure API functionality.
Ensure the application runs successfully with npm run start.
